-- The team's Douyin (抖音) sheet of 19 November 2026: 118 creators from
-- mainland China and nearby, each checked by hand as a Buddhist creator.
-- Douyin was added as a counted place in 0026; none of these creators was
-- listed before, so every row is a new card, approved and owned by nobody
-- until it is claimed, like the rest of the team's cards.
--
-- From the sheet: the name as the account gives it, the country (a
-- province in brackets is left off; "Tibet", which is not on the site's
-- list of countries, is China at the team's word; "Unknown" is left
-- empty), the account type as the card's creator type, Mandarin Chinese
-- as the language, the Douyin
-- address and the follower count. The reviewers' notes and the tradition
-- are not carried over. The picture is each account's own profile
-- picture, stored under creator-cards/profile-pictures/.
--
-- 1. The cards. A Douyin address already on a card is not added twice.
